Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 01:38:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(ai): richer summaries + hardened task extraction

- buildSummaryPrompt now asks for 4-5 bullet points (up to 6-7 for long
  emails), each required to carry real information (purpose, context,
  requested action, deadlines/links, final note), instead of the previous
  terse 2-5 bullet version that often returned only 1-2 lines. Bumped
  maxOutputTokens 700 -> 900 to give the richer format room.
- extractEmailTasks now retries on transient Gemini errors with backoff,
  matching summarizeEmail/generateEmailReply (it previously had no retry
  at all), guards against an empty Gemini response, and filters out any
  task with a blank/whitespace-only title.
